@host = https://localhost:7288
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a job (staff JWT required) -> 202 Accepted
POST {{host}}/api/ProcessingJob
Authorization: Bearer <staff-jwt>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "videoId": "VIDEO-501",
  "cameraId": 3,
  "capturedAt": "2026-11-25T08:00:00Z",
  "videoReference": "videos/VIDEO-501.mp4"
}

### AI -> status callback (Processing)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/ai/jobs/{{jobId}}/status
X-Api-Key: <ai-inbound-key>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "status": "Processing",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-25T08:01:00Z"
}

### AI -> status callback (Failed)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/ai/jobs/{{jobId}}/status
X-Api-Key: <ai-inbound-key>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "status": "Failed",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-25T08:02:00Z",
  "errorCode": "DECODE_ERROR",
  "errorMessage": "Video could not be decoded."
}

### AI -> final result (with one event)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/ai/jobs/{{jobId}}/complete
X-Api-Key: <ai-inbound-key>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "videoId": "VIDEO-501",
  "status": "Completed",
  "modelVersion": "1.0",
  "configVersion": "1.0",
  "galleryVersion": "1.0",
  "events": [
    {
      "eventId": "7b0f3c4e-3c1a-4d57-9a55-0d3f7a1c2b10",
      "trackId": "TRACK-10",
      "eventType": "smoking",
      "eventScore": 0.95,
      "startTimeSeconds": 15.5,
      "endTimeSeconds": 22.8,
      "identityStatus": "matched_candidate",
      "participantId": 105,
      "evidenceReference": "clips/EVENT-001.mp4"
    }
  ]
}

### AI -> final result (valid zero-event case)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integrations/ai/jobs/{{jobId}}/complete
X-Api-Key: <ai-inbound-key>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "videoId": "VIDEO-501",
  "status": "Completed",
  "modelVersion": "1.0",
  "configVersion": "1.0",
  "galleryVersion": "1.0",
  "events": []
}
